CSIRO GASLAB monthly mean values for CO2 at Cape Ferguson, Australia.
These are calculated as the mean of daily values from a smooth curve
fit to the baseline data (with flags "...") using the curve-fitting
routines described by Thoning et al., JGR, 1989.
The standard deviations for the monthly means are calculated from the
standard deviation of the monthly mean from the daily smooth curve
values and the standard deviation of the residuals of each data
point about the smooth curve for that month.
NOTE: the decimal date as listed below is for the middle of the month,
ie the 15th of each month.
